-- Original: ogsm_bring_items.script (OGSM for S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Clear Sky) - hidden items and documents.
-- Adaptation for SRP Freeplay: Eon
--
-- Freeplay extras, module 1: "finds in the world".
--  * flash drives (flesh_up_*) that the original game hands out only as story rewards are scattered
--    over the Zone at the start of a Freeplay game;
--  * 15 secret documents are scattered the same way and can be sold to the leaders of the bases.
-- Differences from OGSM: native SRP flash drives (no second flash set), items lie at the spots
-- (OGSM puts them on dead stalkers), state is kept in info portions only, nothing runs per update.

